00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,617
Four formulas cover every case.

2
00:00:02,617 --> 00:00:09,583
A strong acid is fully ionised, so hydrogen ion equals concentration times basicity.

3
00:00:09,583 --> 00:00:24,531
A weak acid gives the square root of K a C, which in logs is half of p K a minus log C. Bases work the same way through hydroxide, then p H is fourteen minus p O H.

